    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Never before have I felt so powerful, so unstoppable. We took to the gladiatorial arena, and I threw down against opponent after opponent. When I was done, my entire class lay sprawled on the floor around me, groaning, looking at me with malice in their eyes. They are weak, pathetic.",
    "value": "我从未感到自己如此强大，如此无可阻挡。我们步入角斗场，我接连将对手一一击倒在地。待到一切结束，同侪尽数瘫倒在我周遭，呻吟着，眼中满含恶意。他们如此孱弱，不堪一击。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "My joy was short-lived, however. I returned to the dorms to find my secret stash disturbed, my bottles of precious enhancement gone. A red feather sat in their place. An accident or a defiant message? I knew who was responsible. Larbeaks, perhaps the strongest Avian in the class besides me. She's been gunning for me since day one.",
    "value": "然而，我的喜悦转瞬即逝。回到宿舍，我发现秘密藏匿处被人翻动，那几瓶珍贵的增强药剂已不翼而飞。原处只留下一根红色羽毛。是意外失落的，还是蓄意的挑衅？我心知肚明谁是罪魁。大喙，或许是班上除我之外最强的翼族。从第一日起，她便一直视我为眼中钉。"
  }
